  "notes": "Cash-basis village. Governmental lines from the governmental funds statement Total column (p4); interest income 419 is printed under Other Financing Sources below the total (outside_printed_total); transfers out 2,313 net. Spending is partly by object (Personnel services, Operating expenses, Supplies and materials) with mixed General/Street columns. Business-type from the proprietary funds statement Total column (p6); interest, ARPA grant, lagoon loan receipts, loan payments, interest expense and capital outlay are printed under 'Other receipts (disbursements)' below the total (outside_printed_total). Sewer 'Other' 14,385 counted as charges for services per Statement of Activities (p2). The printed Total 'Other receipts (disbursements)' (75,488) is 1 more negative than its lines (75,487) (report_discrepancies), so the business roll-forward is off by 1. Balance sheet: governmental from the governmental funds statement of assets and fund balances (p3, totals equal government-wide 194,533), proprietary from the Statement of Net Position (p1). The only supplementary schedule is the all-funds budgetary statement (p9), so detail is per fund column of the governmental and proprietary statements per user rule; p9 not recorded. Read pages 1-9 of 9"
